{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795360104115201002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"orthogonal-demoniac-kusimanse","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e79c134333fce58d2a6ee68969e734ba371f20dcb9adc404284b0dc481761bb6","event_uuid":"8e8104ed-af58-420d-97e8-5ceb4ee07964","position":{"commit_sha":"5590b3928d4324e8165da1fba652ca8f6086fe80","position":"1795360076331411001-8e8104ed-af58-420d-97e8-5ceb4ee07964"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"de97a97ef74cc90cc5adc5f7bd05892676fee09293f2a453d5a072a03a1de549","event_uuid":"8e995d02-8fa7-4784-b7ed-f5f2d6fba9f1","position":{"commit_sha":"410689b824799e1ff6273713508f1668e6881142","position":"1795360104115201001-8e995d02-8fa7-4784-b7ed-f5f2d6fba9f1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795360076331411001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8e995d02-8fa7-4784-b7ed-f5f2d6fba9f1","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b8dd-85be-1dbb-45b9"}],"description":"## Purpose\nThis ticket is the mechanism-ratchet admission for the `.append.lock` sibling lock in `src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py` (kind `lock`, name `.append.lock`). Every alert appender serializes on that dotfile through `rebar._store.fsutil.sibling_exclusive_lock`. It replaced an in-file fcntl flock that Windows lacks (appends there overwrote each other), and it is permanent: the store's portable lock kernel is the only append serialization that works on every supported platform. Delivered by charitable-tyrannical-hydra (b8dd-85be-1dbb-45b9).\n\nThe repo has one convention for admitting a mechanism added after the baseline froze (`docs/architecture.md` §\"Mechanism-delta ratchet\"; `src/rebar/_commands/sunset_markers.py`). A `# mechanism-ok:` marker at the definition site names a ticket, and rebar refuses to close that ticket while the marker remains. The marker above `_APPEND_LOCK_NAME` names this ticket. Precedents: added-ephemeral-seaslug, unpleasing-starchy-teal.\n\n## Lifecycle\n- This ticket stays `open` and unclaimed as long as the `.append.lock` sibling exists. Do not work it and do not close it.\n- It closes only when a future change removes that lock. That change deletes the marker in the same commit and runs `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --update-stale`.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3bc8-49a4-6c84-4b19","ticket_type":"task","title":"Keep alert_store .append.lock admitted (permanent; stays open while the lock exists)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8e8104ed-af58-420d-97e8-5ceb4ee07964","8e995d02-8fa7-4784-b7ed-f5f2d6fba9f1"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795360104115201002,"uuid":"5d2e183a-e637-41b3-9310-44c85caada77"}